    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105775" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρωγ-άλια</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰλ]</span>, τά, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρώγω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fruits eaten at dessert, figs, nuts,</i> etc., 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τραγήματα</span>
			 (which is the older word, acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				104
			</span></i> (where sg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-αλίου</span>)), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				772
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pl.</u>
				798
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(5).647.12
			</span></i> (Ceos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.79
			</span></i>:—sg. also in <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				124
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mus.</u>
				p.76
			</span></i> K., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.133c
			</span></i>.—Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρωγ-άλιος</span></b> , 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρωκτός</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
